sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant M as Manager Client
    participant G as Managers API (Gateway)
    participant Z as AuthZ Service
    participant C as TeamMetricsController
    participant R as Shared Redis Cluster
    participant D as Directory Repository
    participant S as Session Repository
    participant MR as Metrics Repository
    participant US as Usage Service

    Note over M,C: Team detail = profile, members, last activity, sessions, avg score, AI usage, trends\nInputs: orgId, teamId, from, to, page, size

    M->>G: GET /orgs/{orgId}/teams/{teamId}/detail?from=&to=&page=&size=
    G->>Z: authorize(subject=manager, action=read, resource=teamId)
    alt authorized
        Z-->>G: allow
        G->>C: Forward request (orgId, teamId, from, to, page, size)

        C->>R: GET cache["team_detail", teamId, from, to, page, size]
        alt Cache hit
            R-->>C: cached detail
            C-->>G: 200 OK + detail
            G-->>M: 200 OK + detail
        else Cache miss
            par Fetch team profile
                C->>D: getTeamProfile(orgId, teamId)
                D-->>C: {teamName, members[], createdAt}
            and Fetch team sessions
                C->>S: getTeamSessions(teamId, from, to, page, size)
                S-->>C: {sessions[], lastActivity, paging}
            and Compute team aggregates
                C->>MR: getTeamScoreSeries(teamId, from, to)
                MR-->>C: scoreTimeseries
                C->>MR: getTeamAggregates(teamId, from, to)
                MR-->>C: {avgScore, sessionCount}
            and Fetch AI usage
                C->>US: getTeamAiUsage(teamId, from, to)
                US-->>C: {tokens, calls, cost}
            end

            Note over C: Compose trends from scoreTimeseries and sessions
            C->>R: SET cache["team_detail", teamId, from, to, page, size]=detail TTL=15m
            C-->>G: 200 OK + detail
            G-->>M: 200 OK + detail
        end
    else forbidden
        Z-->>G: deny
        G-->>M: 403 Forbidden
    end

    opt cache invalidation on membership changes
        D-->>C: teamUpdated|memberAdded|memberRemoved (teamId)
        C->>R: DEL cache["team_detail", teamId, *]
    end
